Package: vabaxos-doctor
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, vabaxos-accessibility, speech-dispatcher, wireplumber, network-manager, pkexec, procps, libglib2.0-bin
Description: VabaxOS Doctor: what is wrong, said simply, and put right
 Checks sound, speech, the screen reader, console speech, the emergency
 key (Ctrl+Super+Enter), network, firewall, disk, memory, updates and
 services, says each result in one short sentence that Orca reads, and
 puts right what it can: the user's own services directly, the system's
 with the administrator password. Also in a terminal: vabaxos-doctor
 --text, or vabaxctl doctor.
